    "detailed_description": "<h1>Version 2</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Version 2 was a free update released on April 26th, 2025. It rebuilt PunjiVR <i>entirely from scratch</i> to fix all of the core issues and limitations that plagued the original build of the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Because of the recent remake, please be aware that the current version of PunjiVR has only been out since the 26th of April, and it may have less content than expected for the store page's release date. Still, there are hours of content currently in game with much more on the way!</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1900020/extras/9feb8f9dc4a559cdb1524d28c029444f.avif?t=1753967520\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>PunjiVR</strong>\u00a0aims to create a realistic but accessible war experience that takes full advantage of Virtual Reality.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Satisfying Gunplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Eargasmic</i> Audio</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Intelligent &amp; Challenging AI</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">High Lethality</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unique &amp; Replayable Mission Design</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Large Variety of Weapons &amp; Tools</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Custom Loadouts\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Traps!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>Additional Features:</strong></u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Long-Term Active Development <i>(~Monthly Updates!)</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A Growing Community &amp; Active Developer</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">---</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>VR-First Design:</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">PunjiVR is developed <i>solely</i> as a Virtual Reality experience. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Full Body Physics <i>(including physical crawling &amp; climbing)</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unique Locomotion Controls<i> (combination of joystick movement with armswinger)</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Realistic &amp; Interactive Weapon Handling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Minimal UI and No Laser Pointers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unique Inventory System\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Plenty of Settings/Options to make PunjiVR <i>yours</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">PunjiVR utilizes the unique features and aspects of VR to create a new style of tactical shooter that immerses you into the conflicts of Southeast Asia like no other.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">---</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1900020/extras/cbd6bb378a9c2816148ff67555b2cbd4.avif?t=1753967520\" data-has-big /></div></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1900020/extras/9feb8f9dc4a559cdb1524d28c029444f.avif?t=1753967520\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>PunjiVR</strong>\u00a0aims to create a realistic but accessible war experience that takes full advantage of Virtual Reality.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Satisfying Gunplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Eargasmic</i> Audio</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Intelligent &amp; Challenging AI</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">High Lethality</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unique &amp; Replayable Mission Design</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Large Variety of Weapons &amp; Tools</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Custom Loadouts\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Traps!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>Additional Features:</strong></u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Long-Term Active Development <i>(~Monthly Updates!)</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A Growing Community &amp; Active Developer</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">---</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>VR-First Design:</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">PunjiVR is developed <i>solely</i> as a Virtual Reality experience. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Full Body Physics <i>(including physical crawling &amp; climbing)</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unique Locomotion Controls<i> (combination of joystick movement with armswinger)</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Realistic &amp; Interactive Weapon Handling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Minimal UI and No Laser Pointers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unique Inventory System\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Plenty of Settings/Options to make PunjiVR <i>yours</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">PunjiVR utilizes the unique features and aspects of VR to create a new style of tactical shooter that immerses you into the conflicts of Southeast Asia like no other.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">---</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1900020/extras/cbd6bb378a9c2816148ff67555b2cbd4.avif?t=1753967520\" data-has-big /></div></p>",
    "short_description": "PunjiVR is an unforgiving tactical shooter set during the Vietnam War. Gameplay is non-linear, replayable, and intense. This is not just &quot;another VR shooter&quot; or a tech demo. The jungle wants you dead, will you give in?",
